# The same contract as application-contract.fixture.json, in environment-variable form.
# Placeholder values only. The attestation private key is not here: it is a secret and is read
# from the secrets directory (a file named onboarding.attestation.privateKeyPem) or from
# ...onboarding.attestation.privateKeyPem_FILE.
